  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher kinetic and proxy escalation motivates and legitimizes increased state and non‑state cyber operations (esp. targeting adversary infrastructure and supply chains), producing a near‑term rise in hacks, intrusions and exploitative attacks on AI systems and platforms.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
