  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.8</data>
  <data key="d37">Episodes of kinetic escalation (attacks on tankers, terminals or pipelines) produce immediate physical supply interruptions and trigger risk-driven buying and short-covering in oil products markets, lifting diesel prices.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">persian_gulf_conflict</data>
