  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Heightened Persian Gulf hostilities accelerate Iranian and proxy transfers of UAS/loitering-munition hardware, spare parts, and operational lessons to allied actors (including channels used by Russia), enabling a near‑term rise in Russian/UAS-enabled strike and reconnaissance activity over Ukraine.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
