  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Elevated conflict risk premia raise the cost of capital, insurance and long‑term contracting for compute‑intensive projects, causing firms to cut or delay compute purchases and R&amp;D investments and thereby slowing the growth rate of deployed model capabilities.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
