  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Rising conflict risk premia prompt Middle Eastern buyers and states to place urgent arms and munitions orders, diverting finite global production capacity and prioritized delivery slots away from suppliers supporting Ukraine, reducing the flow of materiel into the Russia–Ukraine theater.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">persian_gulf_conflict</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_ukraine_war</data>
