<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::sanctions_enforcement" target="ai_governance_and_race::model_release_cadence" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">Tighter sanctions and export controls directly restrict access to GPUs, cloud services, and cross‑border finance and partnerships used to train and deploy models, forcing firms to delay or cancel scheduled releases.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">ai_governance_and_race</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::sanctions_enforcement" target="global_energy_supply_sho::diesel_price_level" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">Tighter sanctions on Russian oil, shipping services, insurance and payments directly reduce accessible export volumes and raise transaction and risk premia, tightening available diesel supply and driving benchmark diesel prices upward.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">global_energy_supply_sho</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::sanctions_enforcement" target="persian_gulf_conflict::risk_premia_level" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Tighter and more widely enforced sanctions (including secondary sanctions) force insurers, banks, and freight operators to reprice exposure to routes and counterparties, producing immediate increases in insurance and financing premia that lift overall risk premia for Persian Gulf commerce.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">persian_gulf_conflict</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::sanctions_enforcement" target="us_china_strategic_rival::strategic_autonomy_push" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">Tighter and more consistently enforced sanctions (including secondary measures) against Russian entities directly incentivize China and other partners to accelerate domestic industrial policy and procurement strategies to reduce exposure to Western-controlled finance and technologies, boosting strategic-autonomy initiatives.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_strategic_rival</data>
</edge>
