  <data key="d36">0.9</data>
  <data key="d37">Physical disruptions to export terminals, pipelines and transit corridors (from attacks, closures or regulatory seizure) directly reduce cargoes able to move internationally, shrinking net diesel trade volumes along affected routes.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
