  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">Acute instability or disruptions in European energy flows tied to the war force semiconductor fabs to throttle output or delay production shifts, reducing available and re‑allocatable advanced-node capacity and thus lowering short‑term global semiconductor capacity flexibility.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
