  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.55</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher on‑hand global diesel inventories reduce the likelihood of fuel‑driven rolling blackouts and emergency power squeezes in diesel‑dependent sites, which in turn lowers the frequency of rushed maintenance, degraded monitoring and insecure workarounds that typically produce AI‑related security incidents.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
