  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Sharp drops in on‑hand diesel stocks force factories and component suppliers to curtail shifts, idle diesel‑powered equipment, and reduce truck deliveries of parts, directly slowing the rate at which defense materiel can be produced and shipped.</data>
