  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">A sudden drop in regional refining throughput produces immediate refined-fuel shortages or redistribution pressures that prompt urgent bilateral and multilateral diplomacy to secure supplies or exemptions.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_energy_supply_sho</data>
  <data key="d40">persian_gulf_conflict</data>
