  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">Acute congestion at major maritime chokepoints provokes higher naval escorts, interdiction incidents, and competing security postures by the US and China to secure transit, directly raising bilateral strategic friction.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_energy_supply_sho</data>
  <data key="d40">us_china_strategic_rival</data>
</edge>
