  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">Rapid, observable jumps in deployed AI capabilities (e.g., more capable autonomous systems, surveillance/analysis tools or offensive cyber tools) change threat assessments and military doctrine, prompting reciprocal force-posturing and public strategic warnings between the U.S. and China.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
